<title>USA: Illinois River grain barge prices - Nov 21.</title>
<headline>Illinois River grain barge prices - Nov 21.</headline>
<text>
<p>Illinois River barge loading terminals bids to producers (dollar/bu)</p>
<p>					South of Peoria  change (cents/bu)</p>
<p>US 2 Yellow Corn		     2.70-2.77		up 1-4</p>
<p>US 1 Yellow Soybeans		 7.11-7.15		mixed</p>
<p>			  Contract bids for January delivery</p>
<p>US 2 Yellow Corn		     2.75-2.79		up 1-2</p>
<p>US 2 Yellow Soybeans		 7.11-7.17		mixed</p>
<p>				   North of Peoria</p>
<p>US 2 Yellow Corn		     2.74-2.76		up 1-3</p>
<p>US 1 Yellow Soybeans		 7.14-7.15		mixed</p>
<p>			    Contract bids for January delivery</p>
<p>US 2 Yellow Corn		     2.73-2.78		up 2-4</p>
<p>US 1 Yellow Soybeans		 7.12-7.16		mixed</p>
<p>Source: USDA</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720)</p>
</text>
